# ============================================================
# dpp-monad/envio — Environment Variables
# ============================================================
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit .env with real private keys.

# --- Envio environment (set by Envio CLI; rarely needs manual config) ---
# ENVIO_API_TOKEN=your_envio_api_token_here  # Only needed for cloud deployment

# --- Monad Testnet HyperSync (used automatically when chain 10143 is configured) ---
# Envio uses https://10143.hypersync.xyz by default for Monad Testnet.
# No additional configuration required for local dev.
